sequenceDiagram
    actor Cron as Trigger (Vercel Cron)
    participant API as Next.js API (/api/cron/process-refunds)
    participant Worker as Refund Worker Logic
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant RZP as Razorpay

    Cron->>API: GET /api/cron/process-refunds
    API->>Worker: Execute processRefundTasks()
    Worker->>DB: Query RefundTask (Status: PENDING)
    
    loop For each PENDING RefundTask
        Worker->>RZP: Call Razorpay Refund API
        alt Refund Successful
            RZP-->>Worker: success
            Worker->>DB: Update RefundTask (Status: COMPLETED)
            Worker->>DB: Update BookingIntent (Status: REFUNDED)
        else Refund Failed
            RZP-->>Worker: error
            Worker->>DB: Update RefundTask (Status: FAILED, attempts++)
        end
    end
    
    Worker-->>API: Batch Complete
    API-->>Cron: 200 OK
